sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant W as WS Gateway
  participant H as Redis State Hash
  participant S as Redis Stream
  participant API as REST Snapshot API

  C->>W: ROOM_JOIN(auction_id, lastSeq)
  W->>H: HGET seq
  H-->>W: currentSeq
  alt lastSeq == currentSeq
    W-->>C: ROOM_SNAPSHOT(seq=currentSeq)
  else stream has missing events
    W->>S: XRANGE from lastSeq + 1
    S-->>W: ordered events
    W-->>C: CATCHUP_EVENTS(seq...)
    W-->>C: ROOM_SNAPSHOT(seq=currentSeq)
  else stream trimmed or gap too large
    W->>API: get authoritative snapshot
    API-->>W: snapshot
    W-->>C: ROOM_SNAPSHOT(snapshot)
  end
  C->>C: apply seq monotonic and drop old events
